%%% So it turns out the devs were lazy doofuses and, instead of checking if an enemy's turn resist + status source turn inflict was 0 or less, just checked if the resist was -3 or more to determine invulnerability. This works great until you want to resist a short status and have it actually not inflict.

%Original code:
% 104:  BEQ			R0, R0, .o110
%  108:  ADDIU		S1, V0, 3			%but we add 3 before bailing (?!)

%195458 + 104 = 19555C
%80266B78+104 = 80266C7C
%the above two lines will get clobbered and I'M FINE WITH THAT
%V0 has result of GetStatusTurns
%S1 will hold status summed duration
%S3 has battle struct
@Hook 19555C
