%%% PART EIGHT - DIZZY ATTACK
%%% We want Dizzy Attack to ignore the status counter... sort of. It will formally reset it to '1 use remaining'. Also, since Dizzy now has a de facto 1 turn 'softening' we want to increase the duration a turn.

%We override the address of the function call used to make the actor dizzy, in lieu of hooking it.
